-01-04 00:00:00', '2019-01-04 00:00:00'),(9692, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-04 00:00:00', '2019-01-04 00:00:00'),(9693, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-05-05 00:00:00', '2019-05-05 00:00:00'),(9694, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-12-05 00:00:00', '2019-12-05 00:00:00'),(9695, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(9696, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-04 00:00:00', '2019-01-04 00:00:00'),(9697, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-04 00:00:00', '2019-01-04 00:00:00'),(9698, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-05-05 00:00:00', '2019-05-05 00:00:00'),(9907, 'Join the church', 'Contact Angela at angela@mega.church for questions.', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10383, 'Crew ', 'Small and Large group worship for students 6th-12 grades.   Doors open at 5:45 for grades 6th, 7th, & 8th, meeting time 6:00-7:30. (Pickup @ 7:30)  Doors open at 6:45 for grades 9th, 10th. 11th, & 12th meeting time 7:00-8:30 (Pickup @ 8:30).', '2019-04-09 00:00:00', '2019-04-09 00:00:00'),(10432, 'Nicaragua Mission Trip', 'Scouting trip to Nicaragua, not currently open to mission teams', '2019-07-06 00:00:00', '2019-10-06 00:00:00'),(10434, 'Thanksgiving Mexico Mission Trip', 'Join us as we spend our Thanksgiving celebrating with our friends in Rio Bravo, Mexico. This will be a time of Thanksgiving and relationship building as we also help an amazing family build a new life in their new Casita.  Don\'t forget to make sure your passport is not expiring within 6 months of the trip. We can\'t wait to have you with us!  Registration opens Monday, May 6:  https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=10434&filter=month:11|year:2019|campus:0|ministry:11|listview:0|featuredevents:0', '2019-01-11 00:00:00', '2019-01-11 00:00:00'),(10621, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-12-05 00:00:00', '2019-12-05 00:00:00'),(10622, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10623, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10625, 'Sunday 9am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-09-06 00:00:00', '2019-09-06 00:00:00'),(10631, 'Sunday 11:50am Check-in', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-12-05 00:00:00', '2019-12-05 00:00:00'),(10632, 'Sunday 11:50am Check-in', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10633, 'Sunday 11:50am Check-in', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10634, 'Sunday 11:50am Check-in', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-02-06 00:00:00', '2019-02-06 00:00:00'),(10718, 'Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication M1', 'Please feel free to attend both classes if you have children in multiple age groups, but we\'ll make sure all your questions are answered with one class, including if you are an adult considering baptism.  This is a required, one time only class for parents considering having your children baptized or dedicated. The classes are on how to lead your child to Christ and when to know if your child is ready to be baptized.  There are 3 information classes to choose from: infants, children, and teens.    To lessen distractions in class, classes are parents only please. There are age appropriate locations for children of all ages during both service times.  Depending on if you are already a member or not, there may be other requirements prior to your child/ren being dedicated or baptized. We\'ll be sure to contact you if you\'ll need to do anything else.  Once you\'ve attended the class, if you decide your children are not ready for baptism,  you will be able to register for any Baptism/Dedication weekend.', '2019-01-06 00:00:00', '2019-01-06 00:00:00'),(10727, 'Megachurch Bible Class', 'The #1 Spiritual Discipline for impacting Spiritual Growth is Reflecting on Scripture. This Fall, join others on a journey of Scripture that combines elements from the class formerly known as “Bible 101” and then takes you to the next level of your understanding of the Bible and your ability to reflect on what you read. No prerequisite required, but those who have previously attended “Bible 101” are encouraged to participate.   Register: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=10727 ', '2019-09-09 00:00:00', '2019-09-09 00:00:00'),(10728, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(10729, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(10730, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(10731, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-07-10 00:00:00', '2019-07-10 00:00:00'),(10732, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-10 00:00:00', '2019-01-10 00:00:00'),(10733, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-10 00:00:00', '2019-01-10 00:00:00'),(10734, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-10 00:00:00', '2019-01-10 00:00:00'),(10735, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-04-11 00:00:00', '2019-04-11 00:00:00'),(10736, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-11-11 00:00:00', '2019-11-11 00:00:00'),(10737, 'Megachurch Bible Class', NULL, '2019-01-11 00:00:00', '2019-01-11 00:00:00'),(10740, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-05 00:00:00', '2019-01-05 00:00:00'),(10741, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-02-06 00:00:00', '2019-02-06 00:00:00'),(10742, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-09-06 00:00:00', '2019-09-06 00:00:00'),(10743, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-06 00:00:00', '2019-01-06 00:00:00'),(10744, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-06 00:00:00', '2019-01-06 00:00:00'),(10745, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-06 00:00:00', '2019-01-06 00:00:00'),(10746, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-07-07 00:00:00', '2019-07-07 00:00:00'),(10747, 'Sunday 10:25am Check-in', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-07 00:00:00', '2019-01-07 00:00:00'),(10748, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-07 00:00:00', '2019-01-07 00:00:00'),(10749, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-07 00:00:00', '2019-01-07 00:00:00'),(11331, 'Ministry Platform Training- Forms', NULL, '2019-11-07 00:00:00', '2019-11-07 00:00:00'),(11348, '*Family Baptism & Dedication Weekend and Celebration', 'If you\'ve attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication and have decided your child is ready to be baptized or dedicated, please register here. Due to the amount of prep for baptism & dedication weekends, There is a deadline to getting registered.', '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(11360, 'Family Baptism & Dedication Weekend Registration ', 'If you\'ve attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication and have decided your child is ready to be baptized or dedicated, please register here. Due to the amount of prep for baptism & dedication weekends, There is a deadline to getting registered.', '2019-10-11 00:00:00', '2019-10-11 00:00:00'),(11369, '6pm Check-In Saturdays', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2019-10-08 00:00:00', '2019-10-08 00:00:00'),(11403, 'Dynamic Marriage', 'This is a marriage enrichment course that is interactive. Learn effective communication techniques as well as how to identify behaviors that build up or tear down your spouse along with healthy ways to manage conflict. All of those things are needed in the daily grind of marriage to make it thrive! This is for couples in a ‘good season’ as well as those who are experiencing a ‘challenging season’. No matter if you’ve been married 6 months - 50 years, this class will help us grow at any age! This class is not for the faint of heart though, be prepared to be intimate within a small group and have homework! Don’t let that intimidate you though, because in the end, your marriage will thank you!  Register: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=11403  ', '2019-08-09 00:00:00', '2019-08-09 00:00:00'),(11404, 'Dynamic Marriage', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(11405, 'Dynamic Marriage', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(11406, 'Dynamic Marriage', NULL, '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(11407, 'Dynamic Marriage', NULL, '2019-06-10 00:00:00', '2019-06-10 00:00:00'),(11410, 'Dynamic Marriage', NULL, '2019-01-10 00:00:00', '2019-01-10 00:00:00'),(11782, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-07 00:00:00', '2019-01-07 00:00:00'),(11813, 'Family Camp ', 'Family Camp 2019 *      Register your family to attend or serve for family camp! Family Camp is an opportunity for your family to grow together spiritually with engaging speakers and fun activities for adults and age appropriate small group activities with loads of fun for the kids!! And each evening begins with a family style meal where you all sit down and eat together! Dinner begins at 6 each evening and FC wraps up at 8:30.     $8 per person with a max of $40 per family!  T-Shirts available for $12 each (from infant to adult!) Purchase your T\'s when registering. We will have some shirts at FC, sold on a first come, first served basis.', '2019-01-07 00:00:00', '2019-01-07 00:00:00'),(11927, 'Pathfinders Class', 'If you have decided to learn more about what it means for Megachurch to be your church home, your next step is to attend our Pathfinder\'s class.  Registration link: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=11927', '2020-08-03 00:00:00', '2020-08-03 00:00:00'),(11933, 'Pathfinders Class Online', 'If you have decided to learn more about what it means for Megachurch to be your church home, your next step is to join us online for this Pathfinder\'s class.This class will be offered thru Zoom. Registration will close at noon on 9-13. Contact Angela at angela@mega.church  Registration link:   https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=11933 ', '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(11935, 'Pathfinders Class Online', 'If you have decided to learn more about what it means for Megachurch to be your church home, your next step is to join us online for this Pathfinder\'s class.This class will be offered thru Zoom. Registration will close at noon on 11-8. Contact Angela at angela@mega.church  Registration link: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=11935', '2020-08-11 00:00:00', '2020-08-11 00:00:00'),(12731, 'Ministry Platform Training - Messaging', NULL, '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(12745, 'Candlelight Remembrance Service', 'Join us as we honor our loved ones who have died and we worship the One who came to save.  Sunday, December 1 @ 4:00 p.m. in the Sanctuary.      Embrace Hope with candle lighting, prayer & music.   Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=12745   If you miss the deadline to register online, you can register the day of the service.   ', '2019-01-12 00:00:00', '2019-01-12 00:00:00'),(12786, '11:50am Check-in  Sunday', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-11-08 00:00:00', '2019-11-08 00:00:00'),(12792, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-11-08 00:00:00', '2019-11-08 00:00:00'),(12793, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-11-08 00:00:00', '2019-11-08 00:00:00'),(12946, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(12947, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(13265, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(13266, '11:50am Check-in  Sunday', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(13267, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-08 00:00:00', '2019-01-08 00:00:00'),(13612, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(13613, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(13614, '11:50am Check-in  Sunday', 'regular Sunday 11:50 EC, Children, and Students check-in WS', '2019-01-09 00:00:00', '2019-01-09 00:00:00'),(13728, '9am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 9am WS', '2019-08-09 00:00:00', '2019-08-09 00:00:00'),(13729, '10:25am Check-in Sunday', 'Check-in for all ages infants-students for Sunday 10:25 WS', '2019-08-09 00:00:00', '2019-08-09 00