ortal/event_signup.aspx?id=15102', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '2020-01-01 00:00:00'),(15103, 'Sharing Your Faith With One More', 'Release your fears about reaching out to others. Learn how to genuinely love your friends, family members, neighbors and colleagues into an intimate and life-transforming relationship with Jesus Christ without being pushy or obnoxious.', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '2020-01-01 00:00:00'),(15104, 'Sharing Your Faith With One More', 'Release your fears about reaching out to others. Learn how to genuinely love your friends, family members, neighbors and colleagues into an intimate and life-transforming relationship with Jesus Christ without being pushy or obnoxious.', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '2020-01-01 00:00:00'),(15113, 'Money Matters', 'Take control of your financial future!  Managing money God’s way can be challenging, but you don’t have to figure it out alone.  This class tackles issues of debt, budgeting, giving, saving, investing, work, honesty and legacy.  All lessons are rooted firmly in Biblical principle.    Cost $30.00 per couple  Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=15113', '2020-12-01 00:00:00', '2020-12-01 00:00:00'),(15200, 'Men\'s Growth Group-Iron Sharp Men', 'Iron Sharp Men.    Wednesday 6:00-7:30 p.m. This group is designed by and for men who desire to make God the center of their lives, overcome struggles and learn from one another.  Join us for healing and becoming the man God called you to be.    Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=15200', '2020-01-01 00:00:00', '2020-01-01 00:00:00'),(15258, 'Financial Peace University', 'This class on money management, utilizes videos and materials by America’s most trusted financial guru, Dave Ramsey.  Dave and his teaching team will walk you through the basics of budgeting, dumping debt, planning for the future and more.  It will help you take control of your money, plan for your future and transform your life.  Register here: https: