h meeting time 7:00-8:30 (Pickup @ 8:30).', '2020-11-03 00:00:00', '2020-11-03 00:00:00'),(15624, '***CANCELLED*** Family Baptism & Dedication Weekend Registration ', 'If you are interested in your child being baptized or dedicated and you have not attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication, doing so is your first step.  If you HAVE attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication and you have decided your child is ready to be baptized or dedicated, please register here.   Due to the amount of prep for baptism & dedication weekends. There is a deadline to registration.', '2020-01-03 00:00:00', '2020-01-03 00:00:00'),(15631, '***CANCELLED*** Journaling thru Scripture', 'Join us March 26 from 630-800 for a one evening class on Bible journaling  - which can have an impact on your understanding of the Bible and how to apply it to your life. This class will cover four different methods - micro, guided, creative, and verse mapping. See you in Room 110, supplies will be provided, but bring your Bible and your favorite pen! Kid Care provided when you register 24 hours in advance. Contact Angela at angela@mega.church ', '2020-01-03 00:00:00', '2020-01-03 00:00:00'),(15684, 'Single & Parenting', 'Join us as we support each other during this season of Single and Parenting. This study is designed to connect, engage and encourage those going through the daily struggles and trials Single Parenthood. Come see what God has to say about how you can take each step forward into a new season with your family.  Register Here:  https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=15684', '2020-01-02 00:00:00', '2020-01-02 00:00:00'),(15700, '***CANCELLED*** Spring Break Mexico Mission Trip', 'Join us on our Spring Break Mexico Mission trip down to Rio Bravo Mexico and help build the new Community Garden Casita supporting the Community Garden in the local area. This will be a great time to meet with local families and students currently benefiting from our scholarship program.  **Please plan to attend our info session Monday March 9th at 6pm in the Crossing prior to leaving to complete final documents.**  Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=15700', '2020-01-03 00:00:00', '2020-01-03 00:00:00'),(15727, 'MOPs Checkin', NULL, '2020-01-02 00:00:00', '2020-01-02 00:00:00'),(16015, 'MOVE Leaders Registration 2021', 'This is a registration for all adults who have been prior approved by Derinda Kohn to attend Camp MOVE as a Leader.', '2020-01-06 00:00:00', '2020-01-06 00:00:00'),(16601, 'Bible 101 Class - Online', 'The #1 Spiritual Discipline for impacting Spiritual Growth is Reflecting on Scripture. Join others for this online class on a journey of Scripture that takes you to the next level of your understanding of the Bible and your ability to reflect on what you read. No prerequisite required, but those who have previously attended “Bible 101” are encouraged to participate. THIS CLASS WILL BE OFFERED THRU ZOOM. Registration has closed;if you would like to sign up for our next class please contact:Angela@mega.church   Register:https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=16600  ', '2020-01-05 00:00:00', '2020-01-05 00:00:00'),(16637, 'Family Baptism & Dedication Registration July 12', 'PLEASE CHOOSE THE SERVICE YOU PREFER IF THE CHURCH IS OPEN. IF THE CHURCH IS NOT OPEN, THERE IS ONLY GOING TO BE 1 OPTION FOR BAPTISMS, WE WILL BE IN CONTACT WITH YOU PRIOR TO JULY 12 TO LET YOU KNOW IF ANYTHING CHANGES WITH THE BUILDING.                                                      If you are interested in your child being baptized or dedicated and you have not attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication, doing so is your first step.    If you HAVE attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication and you have decided your child is ready to be baptized or dedicated, please register here.   Due to the amount of prep for baptism & dedication weekends. There is a deadline to registration. 