n ', NULL, '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(18945, 'Communication-A Life Changer   ONLINE', 'Words matter.  Find common ground with anyone, anywhere, at any time, both personally and professionally.  Often our words cut down and destroy instead of building up others (and ourselves).  Learn how changing your communications can make a huge impact on a more powerful life and strengthen relationships.  Registration needed for online meeting link.    https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=18945', '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19034, 'Revelation - Online class', 'There is much mystery regarding the nature of the Book of Revelation. This class will take a look at this Book and try to understand how its original audience made sense of it, and then look to see what this means for our context. This class is online,contact angela@mega.church Registration closes 9-20 at 7 pm. Register here:  https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=19034   ', '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19035, 'Revelation - Online class', 'There is much mystery regarding the nature of the Book of Revelation. This class will take a look at this Book and try to understand how its original audience made sense of it, and then look to see what this means for our context. This class is online,contact angela@mega.church  Registration closes 9-21 at 7 pm.', '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19036, 'Revelation - Online class', 'There is much mystery regarding the nature of the Book of Revelation. This class will take a look at this Book and try to understand how its original audience made sense of it, and then look to see what this means for our context. This class is online,contact angela@mega.church  Registration closes 9-21 at 7 pm.', '2020-05-10 00:00:00', '2020-05-10 00:00:00'),(19038, 'Revelation - Online class', 'There is much mystery regarding the nature of the Book of Revelation. This class will take a look at this Book and try to understand how its original audience made sense of it, and then look to see what this means for our context. This class is online,contact angela@mega.church  Registration closes 9-21 at 7 pm.', '2020-01-10 00:00:00', '2020-01-10 00:00:00'),(19039, 'Revelation - Online class', 'There is much mystery regarding the nature of the Book of Revelation. This class will take a look at this Book and try to understand how its original audience made sense of it, and then look to see what this means for our context. This class is online,contact angela@mega.church  Registration closes 9-21 at 7 pm.', '2020-01-10 00:00:00', '2020-01-10 00:00:00'),(19195, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19196, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19225, 'Crew ', 'Students 6th-12th grade meet for dynamic worship, food, large group lesson, and small group connection.   Registration is open now: https://my.mega.church/portal/get_form.aspx?id=dd49ab6d-71c9-498f-9f12-50c5066e3e01     ', '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19358, 'STORM 2021', 'STORM will look a little different this year! There are NO OVERNIGHTS this year but will, instead be a conference style weekend on Friday Night and Saturday at Megachurch. We will hear from speaker Andy DeNoon, from Sunday Cool Tees, worship with INTV Collective Worship on Friday night and Java Johns will be providing us with fuel all weekend. STORM is for Students 6th-12th grades. Join us to grow in your faith and step into your calling just as David stepped into his. T-shirts are available with registration until January 21, but cannot be guaranteed after! Registration link: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=20625     ', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '2021-01-01 00:00:00'),(19360, 'STORM 2022 Registration', 'What is STORM?  Student Take on a Radical Mission is when students will gather from around Burleson to participate in worship, small groups, and fellowship. This year Megachurch is hosting, but students will register with their home church. The STORM Speaker is Ryan Fontenot with Dare to Share Ministries and the Worship Band is Portraits.    THE DEADLINE TO RECEIVE A FREE T-SHIRT HAS PASSED!!!    The Schedule for parent drop off and pick up is Friday: Check-in 6-7pm, pick up at 11pm. Saturday 9am, pick up at 10pm. There will be a Main Session on Friday Night and one on Saturday Night.  Saturday morning will be worship with breakout sessions on Mental Health, Why God Allows Evil, and a Youth Pastor Panel.  Saturday afternoon Megachurch Students will have an outreach opportunity and games.  Each night Megachurch Students will end will small groups and games at Megachurch.     Current cost is $65.   To register: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=19360             ', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(19425, 'Candlelight Remembrance Service', 'Join us as we honor our loved ones who have died and we worship the One who came to save.  Sunday, December 6 @ 4:00 p.m. in the ARC or livestream online at mega.church     Embrace Hope with candle lighting, prayer & music.  If you are planning on watching online, you may register and submit your loved one\'s name/names  and we will light a candle in their honor.     Register here:    If you miss the deadline to register online, you can register the day of the service.   ', '2020-06-12 00:00:00', '2020-06-12 00:00:00'),(19445, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-01-09 00:00:00', '2020-01-09 00:00:00'),(19446, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-04-10 00:00:00', '2020-04-10 00:00:00'),(19447, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-11-10 00:00:00', '2020-11-10 00:00:00'),(19448, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-01-10 00:00:00', '2020-01-10 00:00:00'),(19449, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-01-10 00:00:00', '2020-01-10 00:00:00'),(19450, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-01-11 00:00:00', '2020-01-11 00:00:00'),(19451, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2020-08-11 00:00:00', '20