tact angela@mega.church Registration closes 1-11 @ 7 pm. Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=20262', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '2021-01-01 00:00:00'),(20264, 'Bible 101 Class - Online', 'Reflection on Scripture is the #1 most important spiritual discipline you can engage in for spiritual growth. This class is a must if you are just beginning your journey through the Bible, and highly recommended for even those who have been reading it for years. Think of this class as a springboard to other, more in-depth studies. This class is online and offered thru zoom. Contact angela@mega.church Registration closes 1-11 @ 7 pm. Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=20262', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '2021-01-01 00:00:00'),(20266, 'Bible 101 Class - Online', 'Reflection on Scripture is the #1 most important spiritual discipline you can engage in for spiritual growth. This class is a must if you are just beginning your journey through the Bible, and highly recommended for even those who have been reading it for years. Think of this class as a springboard to other, more in-depth studies. This class is online and offered thru zoom. Contact angela@mega.church Registration closes 1-11 @ 7 pm. Register here: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_signup.aspx?id=20262', '2021-08-02 00:00:00', '2021-08-02 00:00:00'),(20547, 'Premarital workshop', 'Premarital Workshops  Saturday February 20th 9a-3p Engaged or thinking about getting married in 2021? Join other couples preparing to get married for a one day workshop!  Discover the key components of creating a healthy God-centered marriage, learn communication and conflict resolution skill, and much more. Includes online assessment and fulfills requirements for couples getting married at Megachurch or with a Megachurch Pastor officiating.  Cost $50/couple includes lunch and assessments. Once registration is received you will get a link to submit your payment.  ', '2021-01-02 00:00:00', '2021-01-02 00:00:00'),(20625, 'STORM 2021 Registration', 'THIS REGISTRATION IS FOR ATTENDING IN-PERSON.   STORM will look a little different this year! There are NO OVERNIGHTS this year but will, instead be a conference style weekend on Friday Night and Saturday at Megachurch.  We will hear from speaker Andy DeNoon, from Sunday Cool Tees, worship with INTV Collective Worship on Friday night and Java Johns will be providing us with fuel all weekend. STORM is for Students 6th-12th grades.  Join us to grow in your faith and step into your calling just as David stepped into his.  T-shirts are available with registration until January 21, but cannot be guaranteed after!  Registration link: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=20625     ', '2021-01-01 00:00:00', '2021-01-01 00:00:00'),(20864, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-02 00:00:00', '2021-01-02 00:00:00'),(20865, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-02 00:00:00', '2021-01-02 00:00:00'),(20866, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-02 00:00:00', '2021-01-02 00:00:00'),(20867, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-07-03 00:00:00', '2021-07-03 00:00:00'),(20868, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-03 00:00:00', '2021-01-03 00:00:00'),(20869, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-03 00:00:00', '2021-01-03 00:00:00'),(20870, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-03 00:00:00', '2021-01-03 00:00:00'),(20871, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-04-04 00:00:00', '2021-04-04 00:00:00'),(20872, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-11-04 00:00:00', '2021-11-04 00:00:00'),(20873, '9:30 am Check-in ', NULL, '2021-01-04 00:00:00', '2021-01-04 00:00:00'),(20924, 'Crew ', 'Students 6th-12th grade meet for dynamic worship, food, large group lesson, and small group connection.   Registration is open now: https://my.mega.church/portal/get_form.aspx?id=dd49ab6d-71c9-498f-9f12-50c5066e3e01     ', '2021-12-05 00:00:00', '2021-12-05 00:00:00'),(20925, 'Crew ', 'Students 6th-12th grade meet for dynamic worship, food, large group lesson, and small g