communicators as we dive into what humility, forgiveness, brokenness, grace, and commitment look like as it operates within us and our marriage. We hope you can join us as we grow together! Registration opens January 29. $30 fee covers the cost of the workbooks for each couple. KidCare is provided. If you have more questions before you register, please contact: Paul & Lisa Keese: 817.312.5656/817.233.9226 Phillip & Tiffany Ward: 254.709.0635/254.315.2344 Registration: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=27025', '2021-01-08 00:00:00', '2021-01-08 00:00:00'),(23569, 'Family Camp Registration 2021', 'Family Camp 2021 is coming up! After a year of pressing pause, it’s time to Press Play with your tribe! Parents will get to hear from Carlos Whittaker as well as enjoy age specific breakouts on Sunday! Kids and students will get a chance to worship, serve, and grow together! Register online today for $8 per person and do not miss out on this opportunity to have fun with your family! The deadline for ordering T-shirts is July 2 so register early!! We will have a ton of extras available at Family Camp.    https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=23569        ', '2021-01-07 00:00:00', '2021-01-07 00:00:00'),(23689, 'Family Camp 2021', 'Family Camp 2021 is coming up! After a year of pressing pause, it’s time to Press Play with your tribe! Parents will get to hear from Carlos Whittaker as well as enjoy age specific breakouts on Sunday! Kids and students will get a chance to worship, serve, and grow together! Register online today for $8 per person and do not miss out on this opportunity to have fun with your family! The deadline for ordering T-shirts is July 2 so register early!! We will have a ton of extras available at Family Camp.    https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=23569        ', '2021-01-07 00:00:00', '2021-01-07 00:00:00'),(23690, 'Family Camp 2021', 'Family Camp 2021 is coming up! After a year of pressing pause, it’s time to Pr