ow together! Register online today for $8 per person and do not miss out on this opportunity to have fun with your family! Walk-ins are welcome; however, The deadline for ordering T-shirts is July 8!  ', '2022-01-07 00:00:00', '2022-01-07 00:00:00'),(25589, 'Family Camp 2022', 'We\'re gonna Make Waves at Family Camp 2022! Parents will get to learn from Will Hutcherson, author of Seen, as well as enjoy age specific breakouts on Sunday! Kids and students will get a chance to worship, serve, and grow together! Register online today for $8 per person and do not miss out on this opportunity to have fun with your family! Walk-ins are welcome; however, The deadline for ordering T-shirts is July 8!  ', '2022-01-07 00:00:00', '2022-01-07 00:00:00'),(25590, 'Family Camp 2022', 'We\'re gonna Make Waves at Family Camp 2022! Parents will get to learn from Will Hutcherson, author of Seen, as well as enjoy age specific breakouts on Sunday! Kids and students will get a chance to worship, serve, and grow together! Register online today for $8 per person and do not miss out on this opportunity to have fun with your family! Walk-ins are welcome; however, The deadline for ordering T-shirts is July 8!  ', '2022-01-07 00:00:00', '2022-01-07 00:00:00'),(26055, 'Seekers Sunday School Class', 'A small group for all ages, genders, singles or couples of all types. We study the Bible in an open discussion format. Meet in Portable Building #3.   Contact Daryl or Susan Johnson at hurshi@gmail.com.  ', '2022-02-01 00:00:00', '2022-02-01 00:00:00'),(26056, 'Seekers Sunday School Class', 'A small group for all ages, genders, singles or couples of all types. We study the Bible in an open discussion format. Meet in Portable Building #3.   Contact Daryl or Susan Johnson at hurshi@gmail.com.  ', '2022-09-01 00:00:00', '2022-09-01 00:00:00'),(26057, 'Seekers Sunday School Class', 'A small group for all ages, genders, singles or couples of all types. We study the Bible in an open discussion format. Meet in Portable Building #3.   Contact Daryl or Susan Johnson at hurshi@gmail.com.  ', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26058, 'Seekers Sunday School Class', 'A small group for all ages, genders, singles or couples of all types. We study the Bible in an open discussion format. Meet in Portable Building #3.   Contact Daryl or Susan Johnson at hurshi@gmail.com.  ', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26059, 'Seekers Sunday School Class', 'A small group for all ages, genders, singles or couples of all types. We study the Bible in an open discussion format. Meet in Portable Building #3.   Contact Daryl or Susan Johnson at hurshi@gmail.com.  ', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26333, 'Pathfinders Class ', 'If you have decided to learn more about what it means for Megachurch to be your church home, your next step is to join us in the sanctuary at 11am for this Pathfinders class. Registration will close at 11 on 5-1. Contact Angela at angela@mega.church. ', '2022-01-05 00:00:00', '2022-01-05 00:00:00'),(26392, 'Women of Worth Sunday School Class', 'A small group for women of all ages to join. Our studies vary from a book in the Bible, to a topical approach. We meet in room 109. Contact Judy Cummings at framedezine@sbcglobal.net.  ', '2022-02-01 00:00:00', '2022-02-01 00:00:00'),(26393, 'Women of Worth Sunday School Class', 'A small group for women of all ages to join. Our studies vary from a book in the Bible, to a topical approach. We meet in room 109. Contact Judy Cummings at framedezine@sbcglobal.net.  ', '2022-09-01 00:00:00', '2022-09-01 00:00:00'),(26480, 'Parent Information Class: Milestone 2 & Teens - Online', ' Parents of kids and teens, we are so excited to be here for your family in all the next steps on your faith journey!  If your child (ages 7-12 years old), or teen (6th-12th grade) has expressed an interest in baptism or you are curious how to have a conversation about salvation and baptism, your next step is to attend a one time class via Zoom.  If you have children in multiple age groups, register for the class appropriate for your youngest child and we\'ll make sure all your questions are answered with one class, including if you are an adult considering baptism.    Registration Link: https://my.mega.church/portal/event_detail.aspx?id=26480                  ', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26484, 'Parent Information Class: Milestone 2 & Teens ', 'Parents and Students, we are so excited to be here for your family in all the next steps on your faith journey.    If you are considering having your child baptized(ages 7-12 years old), or you are a student (6th-12th grade) ready to be baptized, please complete the registration for this one time class. Class time is 11:00-Noon.  Please check in at the Connection Point when you arrive for this class.  If you have children in multiple age groups, register for the class appropriate for your youngest age child and we\'ll make sure all your questions are answered with one class, including if you are an adult considering baptism. This class is a requirement for parents considering having your children baptized or dedicated here at Megachurch.                  ', '2022-01-06 00:00:00', '2022-01-06 00:00:00'),(26486, 'Parent Information Class: Milestone 2 & Teens ', 'Parents and Students, we are so excited to be here for your family in all the next steps on your faith journey.    If you are considering having your child baptized(ages 7-12 years old), or you are a student (6th-12th grade) ready to be baptized, please complete the registration for this one time class. Class time is 11:00-Noon.  Please check in at the Connection Point when you arrive for this class.  If you have children in multiple age groups, register for the class appropriate for your youngest age child and we\'ll make sure all your questions are answered with one class, including if you are an adult considering baptism. This class is a requirement for parents considering having your children baptized or dedicated here at Megachurch.                  ', '2022-01-08 00:00:00', '2022-01-08 00:00:00'),(26770, 'Family Baptism & Dedication February 19/20', 'If you are interested in your child being baptized or dedicated and you have not attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication, doing so is your first step. If you HAVE attended a Parent Information Class: Baptism & Dedication and you have decided your child is ready to be baptized or dedicated, please register here. There is a large amount of prep for baptism & dedication weekends. The deadline to register is February 13. This registration form allows you to register for any service the weekend of February 19/20.', '2022-01-02 00:00:00', '2022-01-02 00:00:00'),(26898, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26900, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(26901, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-06-02 00:00:00', '2022-06-02 00:00:00'),(26902, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-02 00:00:00', '2022-01-02 00:00:00'),(26903, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-02 00:00:00', '2022-01-02 00:00:00'),(26904, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-02 00:00:00', '2022-01-02 00:00:00'),(26905, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-06-03 00:00:00', '2022-06-03 00:00:00'),(26906, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-03 00:00:00', '2022-01-03 00:00:00'),(26907, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-03 00:00:00', '2022-01-03 00:00:00'),(26909, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-03-04 00:00:00', '2022-03-04 00:00:00'),(26910, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-10-04 00:00:00', '2022-10-04 00:00:00'),(26911, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-04 00:00:00', '2022-01-04 00:00:00'),(26912, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-04 00:00:00', '2022-01-04 00:00:00'),(26913, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-05 00:00:00', '2022-01-05 00:00:00'),(26914, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-08-05 00:00:00', '2022-08-05 00:00:00'),(26915, '11 am Check-in', NULL, '2022-01-05 00:00:00', '