9.   $30 fee covers the cost of the workbooks for each couple. KidCare is provided if you register for KidCare. If you have more questions before you register, please contact: Paul & Lisa Keese: 817.312.5656/817.233.9226 Phillip & Tiffany Ward: 254.709.0635/254.315.2344', '2022-01-08 00:00:00', '2022-01-08 00:00:00'),(27154, 'MIX Leaders Registration 2022', 'Please copy/paste the following link to complete the required camp form immediately after you complete this registration...      https://ciy.jotform.com/ciy.registration/MIX22TX?=churchNumber=156641&churchYou=Megachurch%20Church&churchCity=Burleson&churchState=Texas&groupLeaders=Derinda%20Kohn&groupLeaders25=lisa@mega.church    ', '2022-12-06 00:00:00', '2022-01-06 00:00:00'),(27155, 'MOVE Leaders Registration 2022', 'Please copy/paste the following link to complete the required camp form immediately after you complete this registration...      https://ciy.jotform.com/ciy.registration/MOV22NM?=churchNumber=156571&churchYou=Megachurch%20Church&churchCity=Burleson&churchState=Texas&groupLeaders=Derinda%20Kohn&groupLeaders25=derinda@mega.church', '2022-01-06 00:00:00', '2022-01-06 00:00:00'),(27241, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-01-01 00:00:00', '2022-01-01 00:00:00'),(27250, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-01-03 00:00:00', '2022-01-03 00:00:00'),(27252, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-02-04 00:00:00', '2022-02-04 00:00:00'),(27254, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-01-04 00:00:00', '2022-01-04 00:00:00'),(27275, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-10-09 00:00:00', '2022-10-09 00:00:00'),(27277, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-01-09 00:00:00', '2022-01-09 00:00:00'),(27281, '6pm Check-In Saturday', 'This event allows children to check-in during weekend services, ages infant-5 yrs old', '2022-01-10 00:00:00', '2022-01-10 00:00:00'),(28020, 'Serve Together Weekend ', 'Worship will look very different March 26th and 27th!  As a part of our 6-week journey to the Cross, instead of gathering in our usual worship spaces, we will come together in groups beyond our walls and serve as the hands and feet of Jesus in the world for #ServeTogetherWeekend. Please plan on serving during your usual worship times in one of three ways:  1. Off-site: designated locations (registration now open) 2. On-site: opportunities for individuals and families 3. Off-site: opportunity of your choice ', '2022-01-03 00:00:00', '2022-01-03 00:00:00'),(28028, 'Kentucky Disaster Relief Trip', 'Update: The team has hit the road to Bremen, KY. The work is not just physical; a mental perspective comes into play when you see the devastation and you hear the stories of the people impacted. Now your part comes into play; join them in prayer for travel mercies and endurance.     Keep in mind that the people of Bremen will continue to need help into the summer months. If you are inclined to join them, please text Allen Miller, Emergency Management (Mayor of Bremen) (270) 543-6576 for more information.  This Spring Break, we are traveling to Bremen, Kentucky, to assist with clean-up efforts from the EF4 Tornado that ravaged this rural community on December 10, 2021.  The need is for 50 single or family households to travel to Bremen to walk 300 acres picking up metal out of livestock and farming fields. The value of the work to the ranchers will be able to return their livestock to their grazing pastures, and the farmers can plant their crops on time.  Trip Dates: 03/15-18/2022  Field Work Days: Wed. 03/16 and Thurs. 03/17  Adults and Children of all ages are welcome  Costs:  Birthday Gift to Jesus will secure lodging, and our sponsoring church will supply food, Brier Creek Church 2641 Kentucky 175N, Bremen, KY; your investment will be time and fuel, estimated costs $200. Deadline to secure your spot 03/10!  You have questions before you commit, please call roxanne@mega.church', '2022-01-03 00:00:00', '2022-01-03 00:00:00'),(28379, 'Good Friday Check-in 6pm', NULL, '2022-01-04 00:00:00', '2022-01-04 00:00:00'),(29351, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-01-09 00:00:00', '2022-01-09 00:00:00'),(29352, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-03-10 00:00:00', '2022-03-10 00:00:00'),(29354, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-01-10 00:00:00', '2022-01-10 00:00:00'),(29357, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-07-11 00:00:00', '2022-07-11 00:00:00'),(29358, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29360, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29361, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-05-12 00:00:00', '2022-05-12 00:00:00'),(29362, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-12-12 00:00:00', '2022-12-12 00:00:00'),(29363, 'KidCare Monday PM', NULL, '2022-01-12 00:00:00', '2022-01-12 00:00:00'),(29409, 'KidCare Tuesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-10 00:00:00', '2022-01-10 00:00:00'),(29410, 'KidCare Tuesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29414, 'KidCare Tuesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29457, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-01-09 00:00:00', '2022-01-09 00:00:00'),(29459, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-05-10 00:00:00', '2022-05-10 00:00:00'),(29461, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-01-10 00:00:00', '2022-01-10 00:00:00'),(29463, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-02-11 00:00:00', '2022-02-11 00:00:00'),(29465, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29467, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29468, 'KidCare Wednesday AM', NULL, '2022-07-12 00:00:00', '2022-07-12 00:00:00'),(29509, 'KidCare Wednesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-09 00:00:00', '2022-01-09 00:00:00'),(29513, 'KidCare Wednesday PM', NULL, '2022-12-10 00:00:00', '2022-12-10 00:00:00'),(29518, 'KidCare Wednesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-11 00:00:00', '2022-01-11 00:00:00'),(29521, 'KidCare Wednesday PM', NULL, '2022-07-12 00:00:00', '2022-07-12 00:00:00'),(29522, 'KidCare Wednesday PM', NULL, '2022-01-12 00:00:00', '2022-01-12 00:00:00'),(29574, 'KidCare Thursday PM', NULL, '2022-08-12 00:00:00', '2022-08-12 00:00:00'),(29715, 'Family Camp Servant Reg', 'We are so excited to have you serving with us and our families during Family Camp this year. Each servant should register separately. If you know you want a Tshirt, please order them here, as we will only have a small stock of extras to purchase at Family Camp. ', '2022-01-07 00:00:00', '2022-01-07 00:00:00'),(29739, 'Candlelight Remembrance Service ', 'Christmas is a time to be reminded of the saving grace of Jesus and those who impacted our lives and have gone before us to their heavenly home.  Join us for this special service honoring our loved ones who have passed and worship the One who came to save.  You will receive a candle to light and place onto the altar as the name of your loved one is read out loud.    Register online to participate in person, or from home, at mega.church/Christmas  ', '2022-11-12 00:00:00', '2022-11-12 00:00:00'),(30353, 'Adult Small Group Leader 101 Training ', 'Are you interested in being an adult small group leader or know someone who is? Then join us for the next 3 weeks as we gather each Sunday morning at 11am in our sanctuary for this training opportunity. Kid Care is provided.', '2022-01-09 00:00:00', '2022-01-09 00:00:00'),(30366, 'Bible 101 Onsite', 'Reflection on Scripture is the #1 most important spiritual discipline you can engage in for spiritual growth. This class is a must if you are just beginning your journey throu